-- Section 148 — Vikings Grade 8 Band Coverage Fix
-- learning_objective=vikings, target_grade=8, is_active=true
-- Distribution: B1(2) + B2(4) + B3(6) + B4(1) + B5(3) = 16 questions
-- Existing G8 topics avoided: handel>plyndring, Island vs Vinland,
--   konger konverterede, kongemagts-konsolidering (all B4, existing)
-- New topics: periodisation, geographic origins, source criticism,
--   longship, Valhalla/Norse religion, social hierarchy,
